From 53fe5a21f929c0f8374205c2206be01fbee3d842 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: GCSA-aegis <aegis@gcsa.local>
Date: Thu, 13 Aug 2026 18:46:02 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Aegis: explain module toggles and expose Ollama model
 settings

chrome://aegis now describes each privacy control and lets users set
the loopback Ollama URL/model, probe installed models, and save prefs.
